&lt;li&gt;Workdays may include Saturday and/or Sunday (e.g. working Wednesday - Saturday)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shifts may include evening and/or overnight shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help with shipping and receiving including moving, packing, and/or unpacking equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow and improve data center best practices and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clean and well-organized work environment&lt;/li&gt;
