&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; This position is based onsite in &lt;strong&gt;Chandler, Arizona&lt;/strong&gt; and requires regular in-person attendance. Candidates must currently reside within a reasonable commuting distance of the office. Relocation assistance is not available for this position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To provide greater transparency to candidates, we share base pay ranges for all US-based job postings regardless of state. We set standard base pay ranges for all roles based on function, level, and country location, benchmarked against similar-stage growth companies. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors, including candidate location, skills, depth of work experience, and relevant licenses/credentials, and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
