&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Operations Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Remote (India), with strong overlap with US business hours&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backblaze is the object storage leader in the open cloud movement, fueling customer success with cloud storage built purposefully to unlock budgets, unburden administrators, and unleash innovators. Together with our partners, we&#39;re helping customers break free from the restrictive, overpriced legacy solutions that hold them back, and blaze forward with the full power of the open cloud in their hands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007, we scaled the business with less than $3 million in outside funding until 2021, when we did a traditional IPO on the Nasdaq stock exchange. Today, Backblaze generates over $100m in revenue and is the leading specialized storage cloud, managing over three billion gigabytes of data storage for 500K+ customers in 175+ countries, including businesses, developers, IT professionals, and individuals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But while there is a lot to celebrate in our past, there is almost as much opportunity ahead of us. We are seeking a: &lt;strong&gt;Senior Partner Operations Manager.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backblaze sells through resellers, OEM/ISV and technology partners, and service providers. The systems behind that (Salesforce, the partner platform, deal registration, tiering, MDF) are only partly built. You will own them and build the rest and assist with setting up the enablement program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the person leadership trusts when they ask, &quot;Is this pipeline number real?&quot; You will also shape how the partner program runs day to day and how it should run next year. You report to the Head of Partner Operations and Enablement and work closely with the Head of Channel &amp;amp; Partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner data and attribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the source of truth for partner-related Salesforce data: accounts, opportunities, and sourced vs. influenced attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the attribution rules, document them, and enforce them. Resolve conflicts before they reach a forecast call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain partner data governance standards, including partner classification, account hierarchies, lifecycle stages, ownership assignments, and consistent reporting across Salesforce and the partner platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the dashboards partner leadership and the field use to run the business, not just view it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program mechanics, built to scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run deal registration end to end, including intake, validation, conflict resolution, and approval, with clear SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage partner application intake, qualification workflows, approvals, enrollment, agreements, and activation tracking across partner segments. Identify bottlenecks and improve time-to-onboard and time-to-first-revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish the partner enablement function. Stand up the foundations (onboarding paths, certification tracks, a central asset library, and enablement tracking in the partner platform) and measure adoption and time-to-first-deal so enablement ties to partner outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run tiering, onboarding, certification, and MDF from request to reconciliation. Measure MDF return on investment and report what&#39;s working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replace manual steps with Salesforce flows and platform workflows wherever you can.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial operations and partner support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize partner discount structures, SKUs, quoting, distribution transactions, incentives, and partner compensation or credit reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and manage partner operations support processes, including intake, escalation, issue tracking, resolution SLAs, and coordination with internal teams to resolve registration, billing, access, and program-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner platform and migration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day administration of the partner platform (Impartner or its successor): access, workflows, and Salesforce sync.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the operational lead on the platform migration, working with IT and RevOps on requirements, data mapping, testing, cutover, and reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight and business reviews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the recurring reporting for internal reviews and partner QBRs, including scorecards, pipeline status, and program health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track program KPIs, call out trends, and bring recommendations to the Head of Partner Operations and Enablement. We expect a point of view, not just a report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Right Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years in partner, sales, or revenue operations, supporting a channel or partner program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Salesforce skills: reports, dashboards, flows, and data hygiene. Admin certification is not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running deal registration, tiering, onboarding, or MDF.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to fix root causes in data rather than patch symptoms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across several partner types and stakeholder groups at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written English. You will write process docs, explain data decisions, and push back on bad inputs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a PRM platforms and with a platform migration or systems consolidation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working US hours from outside the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a cloud infrastructure, storage, or technical B2B company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Role Is Not For You If&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want a mature, finished program to maintain. Here you shape the systems as you go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You need one partner segment to specialize in. This role covers all of them by design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re not comfortable saying &quot;this data is wrong&quot; and then fixing it yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote (India). Must maintain strong overlap with US business hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to: Head of Partner Operations and Enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Backblaze, we value being fair and good to our customers, partners, and employees. That&#39;s why diversity, equity, and inclusion are at the core of our values. We are committed to fostering a workforce where all employees feel a sense of belonging regardless of race, ethnicity, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, socio-economic status, ability, veteran status, and education. We believe that our dedication to cultivating a diverse workspace not only allows us to better serve our customers in over 175 countries, but further reinforces our commitment to doing the right thing. We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;yco28j&quot; data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;101&quot;&gt;About Backblaze&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;103&quot; data-end=&quot;506&quot;&gt;Backblaze is the object storage leader in the open cloud movement, fueling customer success with cloud storage built purposefully to unlock budgets, unburden administrators, and unleash innovators. Together with our partners, we’re helping customers break free from the restrictive, overpriced legacy solutions that hold them back, and blaze forward with the full power of the open cloud in their hands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;508&quot; data-end=&quot;921&quot;&gt;Founded in 2007, we scaled the business with less than $3 million in outside funding until 2021, when we did a traditional IPO on the Nasdaq stock exchange. Today, Backblaze generates over $100m in revenue and is the leading specialized storage cloud, managing over three billion gigabytes of data storage for 500K+ customers in 175+ countries, including businesses, developers, IT professionals, and individuals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;923&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;But while there is a lot to celebrate in our past, there is almost as much opportunity ahead of us. We’re seeking a &lt;strong&gt;B2 Principal Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1wct3r9&quot; data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1104&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1106&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;We are seeking an ambitious and accomplished Principal Product Manager to join our Product team. Backblaze’s B2 cloud object storage offers multi-exabyte, S3-compatible, globally available object storage that unlocks app builder innovation across AI neoclouds and traditional hyperscalers at a fraction of the cost of traditional cloud infrastructure hyperscalers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;The Principal Product Manager for B2 will work closely with key stakeholders to understand the evolution of cloud storage and the customer problems in the space, and determine product strategies and roadmap to address those problems. This person will work independently to lead efforts for new feature discovery and delivery, as well as improvements to execute on those strategies. Understanding customer problems through interviews and market research, and translating them into requirements, is critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;11vcmyo&quot; data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;1997&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1999&quot; data-end=&quot;3163&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13kby2r&quot; data-start=&quot;1999&quot; data-end=&quot;2078&quot;&gt;Drive B2 product strategy and roadmap development through delivery execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vdkxa5&quot; data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2186&quot;&gt;Lead the end-to-end product development lifecycle from discovery through delivery in feature development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lg4hwm&quot; data-start=&quot;2187&quot; data-end=&quot;2443&quot;&gt;Gather and synthesize inputs for discovery and prioritization from internal functions, customers, and partners across the full spectrum of R&amp;amp;D development, including feature capabilities, user experience challenges, cost optimization, and technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;129w6ul&quot; data-start=&quot;2444&quot; data-end=&quot;2598&quot;&gt;Translate complex customer challenges into clear, concise, and actionable product requirements in collaboration with Design, Engineering, and GTM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6hmilr&quot; data-start=&quot;2599&quot; data-end=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Product Marketing to launch and drive adoption of new products and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7g67ys&quot; data-start=&quot;2695&quot; data-end=&quot;2835&quot;&gt;Act as a subject matter expert and evangelist for Backblaze&#39;s solutions, presenting to customers, prospects, partners, and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ffz5nn&quot; data-start=&quot;2836&quot; data-end=&quot;2937&quot;&gt;Establish and track key product metrics (KPIs), using data to guide iteration and growth decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;189667i&quot; data-start=&quot;2938&quot; data-end=&quot;3163&quot;&gt;Maintain a deep understanding of the latest advancements in the object storage market, including customer use cases and competitive offerings, to identify new opportunities and ensure Backblaze’s market leadership position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;bgsy2v&quot; data-start=&quot;3165&quot; data-end=&quot;3181&quot;&gt;The Right Fit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3183&quot; data-end=&quot;4360&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xtfdda&quot; data-start=&quot;3183&quot; data-end=&quot;3288&quot;&gt;8+ years of Product Management experience in tech businesses, preferably on IaaS and/or SaaS offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cjavy9&quot; data-start=&quot;3289&quot; data-end=&quot;3512&quot;&gt;A proven track record of successfully launching and scaling technical products or platforms in high-growth businesses involving in-depth cross-functional collaboration and leadership across R&amp;amp;D and go-to-market functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;35mvxr&quot; data-start=&quot;3513&quot; data-end=&quot;3585&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of cloud architecture, APIs, and security and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hghzlb&quot; data-start=&quot;3586&quot; data-end=&quot;3690&quot;&gt;Proven success in owning product roadmaps, defining MVPs, and driving the complete product life cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;suxm4m&quot; data-start=&quot;3691&quot; data-end=&quot;3837&quot;&gt;Strategic thinker who can translate market trends, customer needs, and technical innovations into a clear product vision and actionable roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uncc2t&quot; data-start=&quot;3838&quot; data-end=&quot;3980&quot;&gt;Deep empathy for customers and users in gathering and synthesizing input, and a passion for solving their most pressing security challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;enizxo&quot; data-start=&quot;3981&quot; data-end=&quot;4219&quot;&gt;Outstanding communication and leadership skills with a collaborative and team-oriented approach to identifying problems, determining potential solutions, and building consensus around your vision with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8kkx42&quot; data-start=&quot;4220&quot; data-end=&quot;4272&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ef3che&quot; data-start=&quot;4273&quot; data-end=&quot;4360&quot;&gt;Experience applying data and metrics to inform product decisions and measure success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1atge3o&quot; data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4381&quot;&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4383&quot; data-end=&quot;4738&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;97kkyl&quot; data-start=&quot;4383&quot; data-end=&quot;4512&quot;&gt;Expertise in cloud storage and computing from hyperscale and neocloud providers, such as AWS, Azure, GCP, GPU clouds, and CDNs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e1uakm&quot; data-start=&quot;4513&quot; data-end=&quot;4586&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mn4se4&quot; data-start=&quot;4587&quot; data-end=&quot;4600&quot;&gt;MBA degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j7233c&quot; data-start=&quot;4601&quot; data-end=&quot;4650&quot;&gt;Application development programming experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c17npp&quot; data-start=&quot;4651&quot; data-end=&quot;4738&quot;&gt;Expertise in applying GenAI in solution prototyping and agentic workflow development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;15vs9r5&quot; data-start=&quot;4740&quot; data-end=&quot;4758&quot;&gt;Backblaze Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4760&quot; data-end=&quot;5234&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vwn5vy&quot; data-start=&quot;4760&quot; data-end=&quot;4797&quot;&gt;RSU grants for full-time employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bnjs6m&quot; data-start=&quot;4798&quot; data-end=&quot;4826&quot;&gt;Annual company bonus plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zpecq6&quot; data-start=&quot;4827&quot; data-end=&quot;4880&quot;&gt;Healthcare for family, including dental and vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15emoew&quot; data-start=&quot;4881&quot; data-end=&quot;4888&quot;&gt;401K.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b0b7ms&quot; data-start=&quot;4889&quot; data-end=&quot;4904&quot;&gt;ESPP program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16dazy2&quot; data-start=&quot;4905&quot; data-end=&quot;4932&quot;&gt;Flexible vacation policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jfw7pn&quot; data-start=&quot;4933&quot; data-end=&quot;4965&quot;&gt;Maternity and paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1oqeirg&quot; data-start=&quot;4966&quot; data-end=&quot;5046&quot;&gt;MacBook Pro for work, plus a generous stipend to personalize your workstation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lmgs2t&quot; data-start=&quot;5047&quot; data-end=&quot;5087&quot;&gt;Childcare bonus (human children only).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vfw8n6&quot; data-start=&quot;5088&quot; data-end=&quot;5122&quot;&gt;Fertility treatment and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lxc1su&quot; data-start=&quot;5123&quot; data-end=&quot;5158&quot;&gt;Learning and development program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jx1paw&quot; data-start=&quot;5159&quot; data-end=&quot;5179&quot;&gt;Commuter benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kwmb5i&quot; data-start=&quot;5180&quot; data-end=&quot;5234&quot;&gt;A culture that supports a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5236&quot; data-end=&quot;5706&quot;&gt;To provide greater transparency to candidates, we share base pay ranges for all US-based job postings regardless of state. We set standard base pay ranges for all roles based on function, level, and country location, benchmarked against similar-stage growth companies. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors, including candidate location, skills, depth of work experience, and relevant licenses or credentials, and may vary from the amounts listed below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5708&quot; data-end=&quot;5772&quot;&gt;The expected salary range for this role is $225,000 to $250,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Backblaze, we value being fair and good to our customers, partners, and employees. That’s why diversity, equity, and inclusion are at the core of our values. We are committed to fostering a workforce where all employees feel a sense of belonging regardless of race, ethnicity, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, socio-economic status, ability, veteran status, and education. We believe that our dedication to cultivating a diverse workspace not only allows us to better serve our customers in over 175 countries, but further reinforces our commitment to doing the right thing.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To understand more about the data we collect and process as part of your application, please view our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.backblaze.com/assets/Backblaze_HR_Employee_Related_Privacy_Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63d32de856f6323a43a277f2/64b0660cd90ac9b4953f7f1d_Backblaze_HR_Employee_Related_Privacy_Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Backblaze Employee Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Backblaze&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Backblaze is the object storage leader in the open cloud movement, fueling customer success with cloud storage built purposefully to unlock budgets, unburden administrators, and unleash innovators. Together with our partners, we’re helping customers break free from the restrictive, overpriced legacy solutions that hold them back, and blaze forward with the full power of the open cloud in their hands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2007, we scaled the business with less than $3 million in outside funding until 2021, when we did a traditional IPO on the Nasdaq stock exchange. Today, Backblaze generates over $136M ARR and is the leading specialized storage cloud, managing over three billion gigabytes of data storage for 500K+ customers in 175+ countries, including businesses, developers, IT professionals, and individuals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;But while there is a lot to celebrate in our past, there is almost as much opportunity ahead of us. We’re seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Principal SRE &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Principal Site Reliability Engineer (SRE) to help ensure the stability, scalability, and reliability of our production systems. The ideal candidate will have extensive experience collaborating in cross functional teams to manage the design, implementation and ongoing management of the Backblaze core infrastructure. You will be approved to demonstrate strong observability skills, process and service improvement and ability to leverage AI and automation to assist to mitigate issues faster and meet customer demand..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a technical leader in Backblaze you will be expected to work across the organisation to achieve our goals. This will include working with our executives and customers. The role will focus long term strategic focus on platform stability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Reliability &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the availability and durability of critical services across production environments and accountability for outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently, take ownership, and drive projects from problem discovery through resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Assist and advise on the design of service health metrics using SLIs, SLOs, and error budgets, and escalate issues when thresholds are at risk; partner with service owners to define/iterate SLIs/SLOs and establish error budget policies and alerting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in leadership on-call rotations, incident response, and post-incident reviews to drive service improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Follow established ITIL/OSS processes (incident, change, problem, and capacity management).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect and Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design automation for common operational tasks, reducing manual intervention and toil.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineering on overall storage design, performance expectation against product SLAs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define the monitoring, logging, and alerting frameworks (e.g., Prometheus, Grafana, Catchpoint, ELK), and help integrate runbooks with FireHydrant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work with CI/CD pipelines, configuration management, and infrastructure as code tools (Terraform, Ansible, Jenkins).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Write scripts (Bash, Python, Go, etc.) to improve system reliability and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering, customer success, product, and operations teams to support resilient system design and operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work with customers to ensure stability prioritization is based around their needs and experiences in using Backblaze products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work with vendors and service providers to troubleshoot service issues and track SLA performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Document systems, share learnings, and help grow a reliability-minded engineering culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead cross functional teams to identify gaps in observability, operations process and define overall prioritization strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify recurring issues and propose long-term improvements, and design action plans around implementing those improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Promote reliability-focused practices within development and operations teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in site reliability, systems engineering, or operations, experience with hyperscalers preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale, production-grade systems, including experience establishing operational procedures or runbooks and bringing others up to speed on them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solid Linux systems administration and troubleshooting skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to leverage AI tools to improve platform stability and scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of storage systems, performance, sharding and storage algorithms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in load balancing services including IPVS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Security-minded operations (patching, hardening, identifying vulnerabilities).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with service reliability concepts — monitoring, alerting, incident response, and root cause analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in at least one scripting language (Python, Bash, or Go).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with containers (Kubernetes, Docker) and microservices concepts required; comfortable operating in a Kubernetes/Vitess-on-K8s environment (kubectl, mysqlsh, Vitess keyspaces).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Hashicorp products (Nomad, Vault, Terraform).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in a SaaS, service provider, or distributed systems environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with ITIL/OSS practices and SLO/SLA’s.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and willingness to learn new technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Backblaze Perks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Healthcare for family, including dental and vision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation and 401K&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;RSU grants for full-time employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ESPP program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible vacation policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;MacBook Pro to use for work, plus a generous stipend to personalize your workstation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Childcare bonus (human children only)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fertility treatment and support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Commuter benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Culture that supports a healthy work-life balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To provide greater transparency to candidates, we share pay ranges for all US-based job postings regardless of state. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors including candidate location, skills, depth of work experience, and relevant licenses/credentials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The pay range for this position is&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;$215,000 to $250,000 per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Backblaze, we value being fair and good to our customers, partners, and employees. That’s why diversity, equity, and inclusion are at the core of our values. We are committed to fostering a workforce where all employees feel a sense of belonging regardless of race, ethnicity, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, religion, socio-economic status, ability, veteran status, and education. We believe that our dedication to cultivating a diverse workspace not only allows us to better serve our customers in over 175 countries but further reinforces our commitment to doing the right thing. We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To understand more about the data we collect and process as part of your application, please view our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/63d32de856f6323a43a277f2/64b0660cd90ac9b4953f7f1d_Backblaze_HR_Employee_Related_Privacy_Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Backblaze Employee Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;yco28j&quot; data-start=&quot;81&quot; data-end=&quot;99&quot;&gt;About Backblaze&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;504&quot;&gt;Backblaze is the object storage leader in the open cloud movement, fueling customer success with cloud storage built purposefully to unlock budgets, unburden administrators, and unleash innovators. Together with our partners, we’re helping customers break free from the restrictive, overpriced legacy solutions that hold them back, and blaze forward with the full power of the open cloud in their hands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;506&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot;&gt;Founded in 2007, we scaled the business with less than $3 million in outside funding until 2021, when we did a traditional IPO on the Nasdaq stock exchange. Today, Backblaze generates over $136M ARR and is the leading specialized storage cloud, managing over three billion gigabytes of data storage for 500K+ customers in 175+ countries, including businesses, developers, IT professionals, and individuals. Our simple, automatic, and reliable Computer Backup product helped lay the foundation for this growth and continues to protect customer data around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;But while there is a lot to celebrate in our past, there is almost as much opportunity ahead of us. We’re seeking a&lt;strong&gt; Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, Computer Backup to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1wct3r9&quot; data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1258&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1260&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Product Manager to lead strategy, execution, and growth for Backblaze’s Computer Backup product across consumer and business offerings. This role will own the roadmap for our desktop backup clients, web experiences, and associated admin tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1526&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot;&gt;This is a highly hands-on role on a small, focused team. You will need to make thoughtful decisions about where to invest resources, align stakeholders around clear priorities, and drive progress through influence, collaboration, and conviction. Success in this role requires strong product instincts, data-informed decision making, and the ability to bring cross-functional teams together around a shared vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1wajri6&quot; data-start=&quot;1941&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1960&quot; data-end=&quot;2893&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uaiibv&quot; data-start=&quot;1960&quot; data-end=&quot;2126&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end product lifecycle, defining vision and roadmap, leading discovery, and delivering high-quality features from concept through launch and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bawrsv&quot; data-start=&quot;2127&quot; data-end=&quot;2314&quot;&gt;Conduct customer and market research, including interviews, usability testing, and competitive analysis, to uncover user needs, identify market opportunities, and shape product strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;35wmcz&quot; data-start=&quot;2315&quot; data-end=&quot;2427&quot;&gt;Translate insights and complex problems into clear product requirements, PRDs, and measurable success criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rws2em&quot; data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2551&quot;&gt;Make difficult product tradeoff decisions using data-driven analysis, balancing user priorities and technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
