&lt;h1&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Technical Program Manager to join a growing Security team, with a focus on program delivery, driving portfolio management and operating model practices for Backblaze.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end planning and execution of enterprise programs from initiation through delivery&lt;/li&gt;
