&lt;li&gt;8+ years of technical program management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of program management methodologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt agile management principles to a variety of development environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ScrumMaster certification a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple complex, cross-functional programs simultaneously in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to translate technical risk into business impact for executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and risk-assessment skills, with experience using program management and ticketing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build trust and influence without direct authority across engineering, legal, and executive teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail, sound judgment under pressure, and comfort operating with ambiguity during active incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Atlassian &amp;amp; Google product suites a plus&lt;/li&gt;
